DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261030T183000
SUMMARY:Treats on the Trail at the Orange Beach Sportsplex
LOCATION:Orange Beach Sportsplex Trailhead\, 4385 William Silvers Parkway\,
  Orange Beach\, AL 36561
DESCRIPTION:Friday 10/30 · 4:30 PM to 6:30 PM\n\nThe Orange Beach Coastal 
 Resources Department and the Backcountry Trail Foundation hold their annua
 l Treats on the Trail at the Sportsplex trailhead. The city lists trick or
  treating\, games and s'mores. It runs two hours on the Friday before Hall
 oween\, so costumes get an early outing.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nD
 etails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-ob-treats-on-the-trail-1030
 .html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-ob-treats-on-the-trail-1030.html
CATEGORIES:Nature and outdoors
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ev_trashbash_navarre_1031-2026-10-31@coastaleventures.com
DTSTAMP:20261026T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SUMMARY:Trash Bash Beach Clean-Up
LOCATION:Navarre Beach Sea Turtle Conservation Center\, 8740 Gulf Blvd\, Na
 varre\, FL 32566
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 10/31 · Time not published\n\nThe Sea Turtle Conserva
 tion Center runs Trash Bash\, a volunteer beach clean-up along Navarre Bea
 ch\, on the last Saturday of every month. Volunteers collect trash and log
  what they find for state and federal marine debris tracking. The center's
  own page names the day but does not publish a meeting time\, so call ahea
 d to confirm.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coastaleven
 tures.com/events/ev-trashbash-navarre-1031.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-trashbash-navarre-1031.html
CATEGORIES:Nature and outdoors
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
